PODRACE
-------

Attract mode works.


SGNASCAR
--------

Attract mode works. The car of its demo is not the one of the cabinet
footage (HOME DEPOT here, CAT there); why is not known.

The BOOTROM (all version) reads from invalid memory regions when loading the
game data from ROM to RAM; that is likely a game bug.

